      "instance_name": "developmental_disability_infantilization",
      "label": "Developmental disability infantilization",
      "description": "The meme implies that individuals with developmental disabilities are incapable of understanding or deserving affection, which infantilizes them and reinforces harmful stereotypes that they are childlike or incapable of mature relationships.",
