      "description": "The meme is designed to target and provoke members of the general public who may hold ableist views or be unfamiliar with the lived experiences of individuals with developmental disabilities. It uses offensive language and stereotypes to elicit discomfort or laughter from those who are not directly affected by the ableism depicted, thereby reinforcing harmful attitudes toward people with disabilities.",
